TEXT 1184 568 Left 0 ;Regulator designed for 250mA of current draw. \nThis is much larger than I imagine will be needed but provides \nflexibiliity for LCD screen and BLE module which has yet been settled on.\n \nBased off lecture content im excpecting: \n50mA for Analog circuit and MCU\n100mA for LCD display
